 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "Walters・品種: 花が終わったら強く刈って葉を若返らせ返り咲かせる。RHS・stauden.de も花後の切り戻し。夏の傷み・暑さの記述がこの品種の文にはないので B（機械は C）",
  "management_type_quote": "Plants should be trimmed back hard when blooming ends, to rejuvenate the foliage and encourage repeat bloom in late summer.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "C 夏前切戻型",
  "heat_west_only": "中",
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[MBG/属] As the heat of the summer sets in, foliage tends to decline considerably and flowering slows down or stops entirely, at which point plants should be cut back hard.\n[NC State/属] They can tolerate full sun but need protection from the afternoon sun.\n[NC State/属] Too much sun may cause leaf scorch.\n[NC State/属] Too much direct sun can cause leaf scorch.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: East-facing or South-facing or West-facing",
  "spread_evidence": null,
  "mixing_evidence": "[stauden.de・品種] Wuchsverhalten: horstig, lockerhorstig, horstbildend",
